{
name = license;
value = "Google offers many fonts on open source terms. Google Sans is not one of them. Please see google.com/fonts for alternatives.";
},
{
name = note;
value = "#Questions on Vietnamese\012\012* Do the multi accented characters have to line up vertically?\012* The multi accents have a different height to their normal variations to accommodate the visual space.\012\012* What is the distance of the dot below dictated by? Visually?\012* Do the hook accents have to come off of the top right hand corner? What is the justification for them coming down into the stem as opposed to lining up at the top?\012* On the hook accent, what is the point of the top anchor? What additional marks ajoin to that?\012* What dictates the drawing of the horn? I have done it so it comes off of the top curve of the O, but I have also seen it come out of the top right, so it creates a shape similar to a g’s “ear”. I prefer the first, but when is the latter preferenced?\012*";
},
{
name = fsType;
value = (
);
},
{
name = Axes;
value = (
{
Name = "Optical size";
Tag = opsz;
},
{
Name = Weight;
Tag = wght;
}
);
}
);
